---
title: "deny_list_v2_add (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_type: ty = type_name of T (with original IDs)
    q_get_type --> q_delegate: deny_list.v2_add(DENY_LIST_COIN_INDEX, ty, addr, ctx)
    q_delegate --> q_config_entry: get or create per_type_config
    q_config_entry --> q_set_entry: set AddressKey(addr) = true for next epoch
    q_set_entry --> [*]: address denied

    note right of q_delegate
        INV-001: requires DenyCapV2 capability (authorization)
        INV-002: deny effect is immediate for input objects
        INV-003: deny effect for receiving starts at next epoch
        INV-004: reserved addresses (@0x0-@0xF, @0x403, @0xDEE9) cannot be denied
    end note
